# NDIS claims language

- Learning records support—but never guarantee—NDIS compliance.
- Never use “guaranteed compliant”, “accredited”, “nationally recognised”, “qualification”, “Statement of Attainment”, or “certified support worker” for Academy outcomes.
- Bronze / Silver / Gold are MapAble capability levels only; always show they are not AQF qualifications.
- Do not reproduce Team DSC content, copy, branding or interface.
- Prefer linking to authoritative public sources (NDIS Commission, legislation) rather than paraphrasing proprietary training.
